<section style="padding:72px 24px 40px;"><div style="max-width:860px;margin:0 auto;"><div class="rich"><p>Stucco painting in Calgary is one of three ways to bring a tired wall back: paint or coat it to refresh the colour, recoat it with an acrylic finish, or re-stucco it over a properly prepared base. Which one fits depends on what the wall is made of, how sound the base coat is and whether water has been getting in behind it. An independent stucco contractor works that out on site before anyone names a price.</p><p>This page explains the differences in plain terms: cement stucco, acrylic finish and EIFS, what cold weather does to the schedule, and what a written quote should spell out. Sandstone Stucco Co is advertising paid for by independent stucco contractors. The contractor who quotes your job contracts directly with you, and every price below is attributed to the firm that published it. For smaller jobs, see <a href="/stucco-repair-calgary/">stucco repair in Calgary</a> and the <a href="/stucco-repair-cost-calgary/">stucco repair cost</a> page.</p></div></div></section>
<section style="padding:0 24px 64px;"><div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <span class="kicker">What We Handle</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(22px,3vw,32px);margin:0 0 28px;">What's Included in Every Visit</h2>
    <div class="feat-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Oswald',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:700;color:#2A2521;margin:0 0 8px;">One assessment, three scopes</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0;">Paint or coating, acrylic recoat and full re-stucco are priced from the same look at the wall, so the scope follows what the wall needs rather than the other way round.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border:1px solid #E3D8C6;border-radius:10px;padding:26px;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(122,90,50,0.05);">
